Alt+Down = Move Line Down
Alt+Up = Move Line Up
Primary+, = Preferences…
Primary+Alt+N = New Empty
Primary+B = Bold
Primary+E = Export…
Primary+F = Find…
Primary+G = Find Next
Primary+H = Replace…
Primary+I = Italic
Primary+N = New
Primary+O = Open…
Primary+P = Print…
Primary+S = Save
Primary+Shift+. = Fold or Unfold Here
Primary+Shift+Alt+N = New Empty Window
Primary+Shift+F = Fullscreen
Primary+Shift+G = Find Previous
Primary+Shift+H = Changes
Primary+Shift+K = Notes
Primary+Shift+N = New Window
Primary+Shift+O = Outline
Primary+Shift+P = Preview
Primary+Shift+S = Save As…
Primary+Shift+Z = Redo
